=== answer_bugfix_summary_vietnamese
Đã sửa lỗi **Hà Nội** trong `lib/locale/parse.dart`:

- Nguyên nhân: parser chuyển về chữ thường *trước khi* chuẩn hóa NFC.
- Sửa: đổi thứ tự trong [`normalize()`](lib/locale/normalize.dart).
- Kiểm tra: `flutter test test/locale_test.dart` → **18 passed**, 0 failed.

Chi tiết xem https://example.com/issues/42.
--- expect
p "Đã sửa lỗi " b"Hà Nội" " trong " c"lib/locale/parse.dart" ":"
ul tight
  li
    p "Nguyên nhân: parser chuyển về chữ thường " i"trước khi" " chuẩn hóa NFC."
  li
    p "Sửa: đổi thứ tự trong " a(lib/locale/normalize.dart)c"normalize()" "."
  li
    p "Kiểm tra: " c"flutter test test/locale_test.dart" " → " b"18 passed" ", 0 failed."
p "Chi tiết xem " a(https://example.com/issues/42)"https://example.com/issues/42" "."

=== answer_review_nested_with_code
## Review

The change is **mostly fine**, with two issues:

1. `Cache.get` can return a stale value
   - the TTL is checked *after* the read
   - see `lib/cache.dart:88`

   Suggested fix:

   ```dart
   final v = _map[key];
   if (v == null || v.expired) return null;
   ```

2. The `retry` loop never backs off.

> **Note**
> This is not a blocker.

Overall: ship it after fixing (1).
--- expect
h2 "Review"
p "The change is " b"mostly fine" ", with two issues:"
ol 1 loose
  li
    p c"Cache.get" " can return a stale value"
    ul tight
      li
        p "the TTL is checked " i"after" " the read"
      li
        p "see " c"lib/cache.dart:88"
    p "Suggested fix:"
    code[dart] "final v = _map[key];\nif (v == null || v.expired) return null;"
  li
    p "The " c"retry" " loop never backs off."
quote
  p b"Note" "\nThis is not a blocker."
p "Overall: ship it after fixing (1)."

